<title>UK: Sole Brent date kept by Stasco - trade.</title>
<headline>Sole Brent date kept by Stasco - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sole Brent cargo nominated from the paper chains on Tuesday was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline by Stasco, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load in the July 2-4 window.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
